{
  "_comment": [
    "MATCHED DUAL-vs-TRIPLE SETTLED MATRIX \u2014 one fixture (runs/simnet60_tri), same 60",
    "stations, same seeds, same truth, 480 epochs = 4 h, graded on the settled half.",
    "",
    "WHY THREE ARMS AND NOT TWO.  dual+slant is STRUCTURALLY ILLEGAL (IF+GF together fix",
    "both pinned channels, so nothing estimable remains \u2014 the loader hard-errors), which",
    "is Odijk \u00a75.1 restated.  So frequency and posture cannot be separated in one step:",
    "    A dual  + single-layer SH   <-- the current FIELD posture",
    "    B triple + single-layer SH   <-- A vs B isolates FREQUENCY",
    "    C triple + slant + GF datum  <-- B vs C isolates POSTURE",
    "",
    "MATCHED KNOBS: all three carry rank_gate_tol 1e-12 and rx_code_bias_datum, so the",
    "arms differ ONLY in frequency/posture.  The tolerance is LOAD-BEARING for A alone",
    "(the dual+SH posture withholds every epoch at the default cutoff without it, SPEC",
    "\u00a712.2) and inert for B/C, whose gate passes at the shipped default \u2014 that asymmetry",
    "is itself a result and is stated rather than hidden.  rx_code_bias_datum is",
    "load-bearing only in C (it closes Odijk rd 2b); under SH the loader reports it",
    "redundant-but-PSD-safe.",
    "",
    "PRE-REGISTERED (written before the runs):",
    "  P1 cb variance factor.  A is expected worst.  The DISCRIMINATOR is B: if B ~ C the",
    "     third FREQUENCY did the work; if B ~ A the slant POSTURE did.  The 20-epoch",
    "     probes said 4.9e5 (dual+SH, settled, different fixture) vs 1.9 (triple+slant,",
    "     ignition) \u2014 this matrix is what makes that a measurement instead of an argument.",
    "  P2 consumer 3D.  The 2026-08-04 record has slant 2.2x WORSE than SH (4.955 ->",
    "     10.696 m) at dual/63sta/30ep.  Prediction: that regression does NOT reproduce",
    "     in C, because at f=3 the code biases have somewhere to live.  If it does",
    "     reproduce, the slant posture costs position and the trade is real.",
    "  P3 clock channel.  C rms and the datum-free contrast should be comparable across",
    "     all three; a large move means the posture is doing something to the clock that",
    "     is not about code biases.",
    "",
    "GRADE: scripts/simnet_grade.py --settle-frac 0.5 (arm C needs --gf-datum, which the",
    "grader auto-detects from the console) + scripts/simnet_exchange.py on A and B.",
    "The CB carry's step response is tau ~ 3.8 h, so even 4 h is short for that channel;",
    "the settled half is 2 h and the level claims are bounded accordingly.",
    "",
    "ARM A \u2014 dual + single-layer SH.  The current field posture."
  ],
  "app_mode": "post",
  "data_source": "internal",
  "processing": {
    "mode": "ppp-rtk-network",
    "active_systems": [
      "GPS"
    ],
    "frequency_mode": "dual",
    "channel_mode": "all",
    "elevation_mask_deg": 10.0,
    "exclude_eclipsing_satellites": true,
    "leap_seconds_tai": 37.0,
    "relinearize_geometry": false,
    "eigen_threads": 10,
    "max_duration_s": 14370.0,
    "satellite_interpolation_mode": "lagrange",
    "satellite_clock_interpolation_mode": "linear",
    "signal_priorities": {
      "GPS": [
        "C1C",
        "L1C",
        "C2W",
        "L2W"
      ]
    }
  },
  "files": {
    "internal_data_root": "./data"
  },
  "model_corrections": {
    "enable_troposphere": true,
    "enable_relativistic_correction": true,
    "enable_shapiro_delay": true,
    "enable_solid_earth_tide": true,
    "enable_ocean_tide_loading": false,
    "enable_pole_tide": true,
    "enable_atmospheric_loading": false,
    "enable_satellite_pco": true,
    "enable_satellite_pcv": true,
    "enable_receiver_pco": true,
    "enable_receiver_pcv": true,
    "enable_phase_windup": true,
    "enable_higher_order_ionosphere": false,
    "enable_code_phase_bias": false
  },
  "estimation": {
    "accumulate_phase_windup": true,
    "estimate_velocity": false,
    "estimate_phase_clock": false,
    "ambiguity_resolution": {
      "mode": 0
    },
    "adaptive_iono_process_noise": {
      "enable": false
    },
    "//iono": "The cutoff, NOT the enable, is the load-bearing field here \u2014 the",
    "//iono2": "enable is forced on by the W6 slice anyway.  Values other than the",
    "//iono3": "cutoff are the shipped defaults, restated so an arm cannot inherit a",
    "//iono4": "changed default silently.",
    "ionosphere_weighting": {
      "enable": true,
      "common_mode_sigma_m": 50.0,
      "std_scale": 1.0,
      "floor_m": 0.05,
      "elevation_cutoff_deg": 25.0
    },
    "//sh": "Field-matched SH posture (_cbq305_2f_12h_d10): degree 15, single shell,",
    "//sh2": "sun-fixed, representation-error demean + d5-keep.  trace: true is what",
    "//sh3": "opens network_vtec_sh.csv (coefficients + sigma) and the per-epoch",
    "//sh4": "network_vtec_sh_health.csv (a00 + a00 sigma + per-degree rms) \u2014 the a00",
    "//sh5": "channel of the \u00a711 item 4 decomposition.  network_ionosphere.csv is NOT",
    "//sh6": "a substitute: it writes x_r alone and is frame-broken (CLAUDE.md).",
    "global_vtec_sh": {
      "max_degree": 4,
      "layer_height_km": 450.0,
      "earth_radius_km": 6371.0,
      "kaula_scale_tecu": 10.0,
      "q_per_degree": 0.01,
      "mean_vtec_prior_tecu": 15.0,
      "mean_vtec_prior_sigma_tecu": 30.0,
      "representation_sigma_tecu": 5.0,
      "rep_error_tau_s": 900.0,
      "rep_error_demean": true,
      "rep_error_d5_keep": true,
      "layer2_max_degree": 0,
      "sun_fixed": true,
      "trace": true
    }
  },
  "filter": {
    "process_noise": {
      "position_q": 100.0,
      "clock_bias_q": 1000.0,
      "phase_clock_q": 1e-09,
      "troposphere_q": 1e-09,
      "ionosphere_q": 0.001,
      "code_bias_q": 0.0001,
      "sat_bias_q": 1e-12,
      "sat_code_bias_q": 1e-10,
      "sat_phase_bias_q": 1e-12,
      "sat_clock_q": 0.01,
      "system_time_offset_q": 1e-12,
      "ambiguity_q": 1e-12
    },
    "initial_std": {
      "position": 100.0,
      "clock": 1000.0,
      "troposphere": 0.5,
      "ionosphere": 5.0,
      "ambiguity": 1000.0,
      "code_bias": 10.0,
      "sat_bias": 10.0,
      "sat_phase_bias": 10.0,
      "sat_clock": 1000.0,
      "system_time_offset": 1000.0
    },
    "measurement_noise": {
      "code_std_m": 0.3,
      "phase_std_m": 0.003
    },
    "stochastic_model": "elevation"
  },
  "network": {
    "//datum": "Equatorial by choice (\u00a79.8) \u2014 see the header.  Overridden by the",
    "//datum2": "generator ONLY if this name is absent from the fixture roster.",
    "clock_datum_station": "S26000SIM",
    "epoch_sync_tolerance_s": 0.01,
    "min_stations": 10,
    "//w6": "=== The W6 + SH-VTEC slice: ONE knob, coupled set forced by the loader ===",
    "estimate_iono_sh": true,
    "sh_health_gate": true,
    "//qc": "=== QC, fingerprint-SAFE ===",
